<title>MOROCCO: TENNIS-HASSAN II GRAND PRIX SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HASSAN II GRAND PRIX SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the Hassan II Grand Prix men's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Marcello Craca (Germany)  7-5 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Franco Squillari(Argentina) beat Juan-Antonio Marin (Spain) 6-1 7-5</p>
<p>Younes El Aynaoui (Morocco) beat Richard Fromberg (Australia) 7-6 (7-1) 6-0</p>
<p>Tomas Carbonell (Spain) beat Bernardo Mota (Portugal)  6-2 6-0</p>
<p>4-Gilbert Schaller (Austria) beat Alberto Martin (Spain) 6-3 6-1.</p>
</text>
